  <entry>
    <title>ComfyUI自定义节点</title>
    <link href="/2025/02/27/ComfyUI%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9/"/>
    <url>/2025/02/27/ComfyUI%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>ComfyUI是一个强大的AI绘画工具，但是ComfyUI能做的不止于此，它本质上是一个工作流处理框架。一个工作流由各样节点组成，节点与节点只要定义好输入输出，就能互相连接。下面我将通过自定义节点的方式讲述，ComfyUI的基本原理。这里我选择一个与AI绘画基本无关的目标检测方向作为本次自定义节点的主题。首先介绍节点的基本原理。</p><h2 id="基本原理"><a href="#基本原理" class="headerlink" title="基本原理"></a>基本原理</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">CustomNode</span>:<br><span class="hljs-meta">    @classmethod</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">INPUT_TYPES</span>(<span class="hljs-params">s</span>):<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> &#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-string">&quot;required&quot;</span>: &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;a&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;INT&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0</span>&#125;), <span class="hljs-string">&quot;b&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;INT&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0</span>&#125;)&#125;,<br>            <span class="hljs-string">&quot;optional&quot;</span>: &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;c&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;INT&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0</span>&#125;)&#125;,<br>        &#125;<br><br>    RETURN_TYPES = (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;INT&quot;</span>,)<br>    CATEGORY = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;MyNodes/Operation&quot;</span><br>    FUNCTION = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;func&quot;</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">func</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, a: <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>, b: <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>, c: <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>=<span class="hljs-number">0</span></span>):<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> (a + b + c,)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这是一个完整的可运行的节点，他包括了几个必要部分：</p><ul><li><p>def INPUT_TYPES(s): 这是一个类方法，定义了节点需要的输入，包括了输入的类型，是否必须（required）或者可选（optional），输入由字典表示规则为：{”name”: (type, {behavor})}, behavor表达了该变量的一些行为，一般和变量类型绑定，有固定键值。</p></li><li><p>RETURN_TYPES：返回的类型，这里只是个名字不是什么特殊类型，但如果想要让下个节点能够接上，那么下个节点的名字得保持一致。</p></li><li><p>CATEGORY：节点的类型，方便在节点库中查询。</p></li><li><p>FUNCTION：处理函数，定义了该节点的处理逻辑和返回值。它的输入由INPUT_TYPES确定</p></li></ul><h2 id="目标检测案例"><a href="#目标检测案例" class="headerlink" title="目标检测案例"></a>目标检测案例</h2><h3 id="加载模型"><a href="#加载模型" class="headerlink" title="加载模型"></a>加载模型</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">UltralyticsModelLoader</span>:<br><span class="hljs-meta">    @classmethod</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">INPUT_TYPES</span>(<span class="hljs-params">s</span>):<br>        models_dir = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;models/ultralytics&quot;</span>  <span class="hljs-comment"># Update with the appropriate directory</span><br>        files = []<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> root, dirs, filenames <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> os.walk(models_dir):<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> filename <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> filenames:<br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> filename.endswith(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;.pt&quot;</span>):<br>                    relative_path = os.path.relpath(<br>                        os.path.join(root, filename), models_dir<br>                    )<br>                    files.append(relative_path)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;required&quot;</span>: &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;model_path&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-built_in">sorted</span>(files), &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;model_upload&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">True</span>&#125;)&#125;&#125;<br><br>    CATEGORY = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;MyNodes/Model&quot;</span><br>    RETURN_TYPES = (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;ULTRALYTICS_MODEL&quot;</span>,)<br>    FUNCTION = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;load_model&quot;</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">load_model</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, model_path</span>):<br>        model_full_path = os.path.join(<br>            <span class="hljs-string">&quot;models/ultralytics&quot;</span>, model_path<br>        )  <span class="hljs-comment"># Update with the appropriate directory</span><br>        model = YOLO(model_full_path)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> (model,)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这里的ULTRALYTICS_MODEL并不是定义的特殊类型，只要名字保持一致就能和其他节点连接，例如下面的UltralyticsInference节点。</p><h3 id="模型推理"><a href="#模型推理" class="headerlink" title="模型推理"></a>模型推理</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br><span class="line">78</span><br><span class="line">79</span><br><span class="line">80</span><br><span class="line">81</span><br><span class="line">82</span><br><span class="line">83</span><br><span class="line">84</span><br><span class="line">85</span><br><span class="line">86</span><br><span class="line">87</span><br><span class="line">88</span><br><span class="line">89</span><br><span class="line">90</span><br><span class="line">91</span><br><span class="line">92</span><br><span class="line">93</span><br><span class="line">94</span><br><span class="line">95</span><br><span class="line">96</span><br><span class="line">97</span><br><span class="line">98</span><br><span class="line">99</span><br><span class="line">100</span><br><span class="line">101</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">UltralyticsInference</span>:<br>    <span class="hljs-comment"># ref: &quot;https://github.com/kadirnar/ComfyUI-YOLO/blob/8c7d8fd0e5eaa5569f04be1e8f4219801d682624/nodes.py#L817C1-L874C78&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">    @classmethod</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">INPUT_TYPES</span>(<span class="hljs-params">s</span>):<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> &#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-string">&quot;required&quot;</span>: &#123;<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;model&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;ULTRALYTICS_MODEL&quot;</span>,),<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;image&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;IMAGE&quot;</span>,),<br>            &#125;,<br>            <span class="hljs-string">&quot;optional&quot;</span>: &#123;<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;conf&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;FLOAT&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0.25</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;min&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;max&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;step&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0.01</span>&#125;),<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;iou&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;FLOAT&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0.7</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;min&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;max&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;step&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0.01</span>&#125;),<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;height&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;INT&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">640</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;min&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">64</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;max&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1280</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;step&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">32</span>&#125;),<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;width&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;INT&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">640</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;min&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">64</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;max&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1280</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;step&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">32</span>&#125;),<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;device&quot;</span>: ([<span class="hljs-string">&quot;cuda:0&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;cpu&quot;</span>],),<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;half&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;BOOLEAN&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">False</span>&#125;),<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;augment&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;BOOLEAN&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">False</span>&#125;),<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;agnostic_nms&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;BOOLEAN&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">False</span>&#125;),<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;classes&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;STRING&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-string">&quot;None&quot;</span>&#125;),<br>            &#125;,<br>        &#125;<br><br>    RETURN_TYPES = (<br>        <span class="hljs-string">&quot;ULTRALYTICS_RESULTS&quot;</span>,<br>        <span class="hljs-string">&quot;IMAGE&quot;</span>,<br>        <span class="hljs-string">&quot;BOXES&quot;</span>,<br>        <span class="hljs-string">&quot;MASKS&quot;</span>,<br>        <span class="hljs-string">&quot;PROBABILITIES&quot;</span>,<br>        <span class="hljs-string">&quot;KEYPOINTS&quot;</span>,<br>        <span class="hljs-string">&quot;OBB&quot;</span>,<br>        <span class="hljs-string">&quot;LABELS&quot;</span>,<br>    )<br>    FUNCTION = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;inference&quot;</span><br>    CATEGORY = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;MyNodes/Model&quot;</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">inference</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span><br><span class="hljs-params">        self,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">        model,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">        image,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">        conf=<span class="hljs-number">0.25</span>,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">        iou=<span class="hljs-number">0.7</span>,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">        height=<span class="hljs-number">640</span>,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">        width=<span class="hljs-number">640</span>,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">        device=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;cuda:0&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">        half=<span class="hljs-literal">False</span>,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">        augment=<span class="hljs-literal">False</span>,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">        agnostic_nms=<span class="hljs-literal">False</span>,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">        classes=<span class="hljs-literal">None</span>,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">    </span>):<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> classes == <span class="hljs-string">&quot;None&quot;</span>:<br>            class_list = <span class="hljs-literal">None</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:<br>            class_list = [<span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(cls.strip()) <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> cls <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> classes.split(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;,&quot;</span>)]<br><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> image.shape[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] &gt; <span class="hljs-number">1</span>:<br>            batch_size = image.shape[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>]<br>            results = []<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> i <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(batch_size):<br>                yolo_image = image[i].unsqueeze(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>).permute(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">3</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)<br>                result = model.predict(<br>                    yolo_image,<br>                    conf=conf,<br>                    iou=iou,<br>                    imgsz=(height, width),<br>                    device=device,<br>                    half=half,<br>                    augment=augment,<br>                    agnostic_nms=agnostic_nms,<br>                    classes=class_list,<br>                )<br>                results.append(result)<br><br>            boxes = [result[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].boxes.xywh <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> result <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> results]<br>            masks = [result[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].masks <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> result <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> results]<br>            probs = [result[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].probs <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> result <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> results]<br>            keypoints = [result[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].keypoints <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> result <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> results]<br>            obb = [result[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].obb <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> result <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> results]<br>            labels = [result[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].boxes.cls.cpu().tolist() <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> result <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> results]<br><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:<br>            yolo_image = image.permute(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">3</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)<br>            results = model.predict(<br>                yolo_image,<br>                conf=conf,<br>                iou=iou,<br>                imgsz=(height, width),<br>                device=device,<br>                half=half,<br>                augment=augment,<br>                agnostic_nms=agnostic_nms,<br>                classes=class_list,<br>            )<br><br>            boxes = results[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].boxes.xywh<br>            masks = results[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].masks<br>            probs = results[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].probs<br>            keypoints = results[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].keypoints<br>            obb = results[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].obb<br>            labels = results[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].boxes.cls.cpu().tolist()<br><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> (results, image, boxes, masks, probs, keypoints, obb, labels,)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="结果可视化"><a href="#结果可视化" class="headerlink" title="结果可视化"></a>结果可视化</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">UltralyticsVisualization</span>:<br><span class="hljs-meta">    @classmethod</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">INPUT_TYPES</span>(<span class="hljs-params">s</span>):<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> &#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-string">&quot;required&quot;</span>: &#123;<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;results&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;ULTRALYTICS_RESULTS&quot;</span>,),<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;image&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;IMAGE&quot;</span>,),<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;line_width&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;INT&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">3</span>&#125;),<br>                <span class="hljs-string">&quot;font_size&quot;</span>: (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;INT&quot;</span>, &#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;default&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1</span>&#125;),<br>            &#125;,<br>        &#125;<br><br>    RETURN_TYPES = (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;IMAGE&quot;</span>,)<br>    FUNCTION = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;visualize&quot;</span><br>    CATEGORY = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;MyNodes/Images&quot;</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">visualize</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, image, results, line_width=<span class="hljs-number">3</span>, font_size=<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, sam=<span class="hljs-literal">False</span></span>):<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> image.shape[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] &gt; <span class="hljs-number">1</span>:<br>            <span class="hljs-comment"># batch_size = image.shape[0]</span><br>            annotated_frames = []<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> result <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> results:<br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> r <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> result:<br>                    im_bgr = r.plot(<br>                        line_width=line_width, font_size=font_size<br>                    )  <span class="hljs-comment"># BGR-order numpy array</span><br>                    annotated_frames.append(im_bgr)<br><br>            tensor_image = torch.stack(<br>                [<br>                    torch.from_numpy(np.array(frame).astype(np.float32) / <span class="hljs-number">255.0</span>)<br>                    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> frame <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> annotated_frames<br>                ]<br>            )<br><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:<br>            annotated_frames = []<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> r <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> results:<br>                im_bgr = r.plot(<br>                    line_width=line_width, font_size=font_size<br>                )  <span class="hljs-comment"># BGR-order numpy array</span><br>                annotated_frames.append(im_bgr)<br><br>            tensor_image = torch.stack(<br>                [<br>                    torch.from_numpy(np.array(frame).astype(np.float32) / <span class="hljs-number">255.0</span>)<br>                    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> frame <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> annotated_frames<br>                ]<br>            )<br><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> (tensor_image,)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
