    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>参考：<a href="https://openart.ai/workflows/datou/minimalist-portrait/ubwU2IrFLcJ4nkkPNwNc">工作流</a></p><h2 id="模型准备"><a href="#模型准备" class="headerlink" title="模型准备"></a>模型准备</h2><p>flux模型：<br><a href="https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux1-dev/blob/main/flux1-dev-fp8.safetensors">flux</a><br>lora：<br><a href="https://civitai.com/models/437067/organic-sauce-fluxpony?modelVersionId=1000905">人物风格</a><br><a href="https://www.liblib.art/modelinfo/81c7f7400971452fb5afafbac5ec5a49">极简主义</a><br><a href="https://huggingface.co/alimama-creative/FLUX.1-Turbo-Alpha/blob/main/diffusion_pytorch_model.safetensors">inpainting</a></p>]]></content>
    
    
